  "subtitle": "Kimchi and pork belly stew",
  "excerpt": "Kimchi jjigae is a bold, deeply flavoured stew made from well-fermented kimchi and pork belly. The longer the kimchi has aged, the better the stew. Tofu is added at the end for a soft contrast to the rich, tangy broth.",
